# Why Do APIs Exist?

Without APIs:

- Applications cannot communicate
- Mobile apps cannot retrieve data
- Websites cannot authenticate users
- Payment gateways cannot process payments
- Cloud services cannot integrate
- Microservices cannot exchange information

APIs standardize communication between software systems.

