# API vs Web Application

| Web Application | API |
|-----------------|-----|
| Designed for humans | Designed for software |
| Returns HTML | Returns structured data |
| Uses graphical interface | Uses programmatic interface |
| Browser interaction | Application interaction |
| Displays pages | Exchanges data |
| User clicks buttons | Client sends requests |

Example:

Web Page

```
https://shop.example.com/products
```

API

```
https://api.shop.example.com/products
```

The webpage returns HTML.

The API returns JSON.

